    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty optimistic view. But we're talking about real people losing their livelihoods and companies seeing huge volatility in the markets. Can you go into more detail about the specific risks to market stability and the actual breakdown of the supply chains in the energy sector?",
